      "content": "The Enlighten Systems API is a JSON-based API that provides access to performance data for a PV system. By using the Enlighten Systems API, you agree to the Enphase Energy API License Agreement.\n\nPlease note that the Enlighten Systems API does not provide performance data at a panel or microinverter level.",
